ntion within the scientific community, earning Curtis recognition as a rising star in her field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"This publication serves as concrete evidence of Curtis's affiliation with the University of Missouri, as the article explicitly lists her affiliation with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Chapter 5: University Records and Testimonials\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"A thorough examination of university records reveals Curtis's enrollment in the graduate program, as well as her participation in various academic and research-related activities.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, testimonials from colleagues and mentors, including Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Smith, attest to Curtis's dedication, work ethic, and significant contributions to the research community at the University of Missouri.\"}]}"
